	(text "AIN1 front end: surge capacitor, 4-20 mA shunt and the top of the 0-30 V divider"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 12.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd49348e-ca72-5ced-ae4c-508761bdf13f")
	)
	(text_box "WHAT IT DOES\nAIN1 measures a 0-30 V sensor voltage on J1 pin 11. A voltage divider scales it down for the ADC: R901 + R902 (99.8k) here,\nR903 (10k) in the AIN1 ADC module, so 30 V on the pin becomes 2.73 V at the ADC (ratio 0.0911, 110 kOhm input resistance).\nC901 catches fast spikes right at the pin. Fit R904 only for a 4-20 mA sensor: it turns the current into 0.48-2.4 V.\n\nPINS OF THIS MODULE (its block on the top sheet)\nAIN1_RAW (in): sensor voltage from J1 pin 11 (Vehicle net class: 0.8 mm clearance); sensor ground on J1 pin 2\nAIN1_ADC (out): divided voltage to the AIN1 ADC module (R903, C902, D901, ADS1115 AIN0)\nGND: ground\nPower and ground reach the parts on this sheet only through these pins: the ground and supply symbols drawn on this sheet are local to it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 17.78 0)
		(size 265 24.5)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "766f1f0c-8d94-5224-adab-7ac3632e4b47")
	)
	(rectangle
		(start 76.2 96.52)
		(end 99.06 124.46)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type dash)
			(color 200 60 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(uuid "827dab9d-b64f-51f5-9e74-321711748c22")
	)
	(text "at J1 pin 11"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.8 97.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d4b7e178-9612-5420-8ba7-44eaf93b4359")
	)
	(text "C901 sits right at J1 pin 11, where a -600 V spike (ISO 7637 pulse 1) arrives;\nits GND pad gets a via straight into the GND plane.\nR901 and R902 are 1206 parts in series: together they stand off the high-voltage\npulse. Keep the AIN1 tracks 8 mm or more from the 5V buck switch node (LM_SW)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 200 60 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1b7e58da-d0e5-50f1-bf32-ca1e2a4c2851")
	)
	(text_box "PARTS AND THEIR JOBS\nC901: 10 nF 1 kV capacitor at the J1 pin: absorbs fast surge spikes before they reach the resistors.\nR904: 120R 0.1 % (1206), NOT FITTED (DNP): solder it in for a 4-20 mA sensor (0.48-2.4 V). Leave it out for voltage sensors: with it fitted, 24 V on AIN1 would burn 4.8 W.\nR901, R902: 2 x 49.9k 0.1 % (1206) in series: the top of the divider. Two resistors share a high-voltage pulse; 0.1 % keeps the reading accurate without calibration.\nAIN1_MID: Net label: the point between R901 and R902."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 156 0)
		(size 155 18.35)
		(margins 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5)
		(stroke
			(width 0.1524)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e6ddda39-1046-56d6-ab22-81fe8074f7ce")
	)
